<h1 data-copy-en="Character Directory" data-copy-zh="角色目录">Character Directory</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find every character A–Z with a small portrait and the same name spelling used in the game." data-copy-zh="用小头像与游戏中的英文姓名对照人物，按A–Z查找对应指南。">Find every character A–Z with a small portrait and the same name spelling used in the game.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
