<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><h2>Find a character</h2><p>Match the portrait first, then select the name. Names keep the same spelling as the game. Some characters offer services, skills or brief events rather than a full personal route; each guide explains what is actually available.</p><nav aria-label="Character initials" class="wiki-directory-letters"><a href="#en-letter-a">A</a><a href="#en-letter-b">B</a><a href="#en-letter-c">C</a><a href="#en-letter-d">D</a><a href="#en-letter-e">E</a><a href="#en-letter-f">F</a><a href="#en-letter-g">G</a><a href="#en-letter-h">H</a><a href="#en-letter-i">I</a><a href="#en-letter-j">J</a><a href="#en-letter-k">K</a><a href="#en-letter-l">L</a><a href="#en-letter-m">M</a><a href="#en-letter-n">N</a><a href="#en-letter-o">O</a><a href="#en-letter-p">P</a><a href="#en-letter-r">R</a><a href="#en-letter-s">S</a><a href="#en-letter-t">T</a><a href="#en-letter-u">U</a><a href="#en-letter-v">V</a><a href="#en-letter-w">W</a><a href="#en-letter-y">Y</a><a href="#en-letter-z">Z</a></nav></section><section id="en-names-a-f"><h2>A–F</h2><h3 id="en-letter-a">A</h3><div class="wiki-directory-grid"><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-aria.html"><img alt="Portrait of A.R.I.A." decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/aria.webp" width="56"/><span>A.R.I.A.</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-aaliyah.html"><img alt="Portrait of Aaliyah" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/aaliyah.webp" width="56"/><span>Aaliyah</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-abby.html"><img alt="Portrait of Abby" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/abby.webp" width="56"/><span>Abby</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-aimy.html"><img alt="Portrait of AIMy" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/aimy.webp" width="56"/><span>AIMy</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-akira.html"><img alt="Portrait of Akira" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/akira.webp" width="56"/><span>Akira</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-amelia.html"><img alt="Portrait of Amelia" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/amelia.webp" width="56"/><span>Amelia</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-andi.html"><img alt="Portrait of Andi" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/andi.webp" width="56"/><span>Andi</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-annette.html"><img alt="Portrait of Annette" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/annette.webp" width="56"/><span>Annette</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-anthrax.html"><img alt="Portrait of Anthrax" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/anthrax.webp" width="56"/><span>Anthrax</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-arachne.html"><img alt="Portrait of Arachne" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/arachne.webp" width="56"/><span>Arachne</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-archie.html"><img alt="Portrait of ARCHIE" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/archie.webp" width="56"/><span>ARCHIE</span></a><a class="wiki-directory-person" href="character-arestes.html"><img alt="Portrait of Arestes" decoding="async" height="56" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/character-thumbnails/arestes.webp" wid